comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T20:33:58.132Z",codex-root,Plan created only after all-status full tracker inspection and duplicate searches; no existing item owns this exact typed contract set.
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T20:33:58.132Z",codex-root,"No credentials, URLs, entity identifiers, raw manifests, descriptions, or setup timings may enter PM artifacts, commits, logs retained in Git, or PR text."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T20:33:58.132Z",codex-root,A cohesive typed discovery tranche is preferable to freezing every integration-specific WebSocket command; generic passthrough remains mandatory.
